B = [
('Hindustan Motors','South Asia','1950s-1990s','cars','In the style of Hindustan Motors, stately, sturdy, dated 1950s British-inspired formality. Rounded, bulbous volumes with a domed crown and a tall, upright, slightly pompous frontal presence. Chrome used as thin edging and as a few bold vertical accents, with one small winged ornament as a crowning flourish. Swelling curves, thin slender supports and plain painted metal surfaces with fine line work. Interiors are wide, plain and practical. Palette of ivory white, black, dull grey, taxi yellow and olive green. Dignified, unhurried and built to last through heat and dust.'),
('Lada','Russia and Eastern Europe','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Lada, frugal, dour, boxy Soviet-era practicality. Simple squared-off massing built from flat panels, thin chrome edging, short overhangs and an upright posture. Details are plain, round or rectangular, with chrome rims and one horizontal bar as the only flourish. Generous glass, slim supports, small rectangular accents in orange and red. Brown or beige vinyl and brown plastic textures indoors. Palette of dusty pink, beige, ochre, brown, dark green and cherry red. Modest, utilitarian and quietly stubborn, with no attempt at glamour.'),
('Volga','Russia and Eastern Europe','1950s-60s','cars','In the style of Volga, dignified, plump, official mid-century Soviet presence. Rounded, pontoon-like massing with a wide chrome mouth shape crowned by a single leaping animal ornament. Bold chrome side trim with a stripe, large chrome edging, round chrome details and fine rounded fins in later forms. Thin supports and wide wraparound glass. Wide bench seating and mottled plastic textures. Palette of ivory over pale green, dark grey and black for officials, light blue and cream with a chequer stripe for working use. Solid, proud and bureaucratic.'),
('ZIL','Russia and Eastern Europe','1950s-70s','cars','In the style of ZIL, heavy, imposing, ceremonial and austere Soviet state grandeur. Huge length and width, tall flat sides, a formal upright top line and a stately slab body in black gloss. Heavy chrome of bold vertical bars, wide edging with big bullet shapes, thin trim and white bands, with a single bright star emblem. Interiors of wool broadcloth, lace curtains, fold-down seating and massive wooden panels. Palette of black, deep burgundy, dark grey and cream. Stern, formal, secretive and built to impress.'),
('BYD','East Asia','2020s','cars','In the style of BYD, smooth, techy, friendly electric-age design with dragon-face or ocean-inspired styling. Wide, closed, calm frontal surfaces, slim LED lines drawn out into sharp wing shapes and a bright full-width bar with a dotted pattern. Flush details, a rounded flowing body with a curved top, a chrome accent strip and a stylised three-letter emblem in bright metal. Leaf or blade patterns, quilted leather and floating forms. Palette of arctic white, cosmos black, ocean blue, surf green and red. Clean, futuristic and approachable.'),
('Hongqi','East Asia','1960s-present','cars','In the style of Hongqi, majestic, ceremonial and traditional Chinese state grandeur. A huge waterfall of tall chrome vertical bars, a flag-shaped red emblem, long stately massing and a formal upright top line with rounded-square details. Early forms add palace-lantern style details, thin supports, white bands and wide chrome edging. Modern forms add a flowing long front with a central ridge and a slim full-width light line. Red wood, cream leather and silk-like fabrics. Palette of black, deep red, gold and ivory. Solemn, imperial and proud.'),
('Holden','Oceania','1970s','cars','In the style of Holden, tough, sunburnt, no-nonsense Australian muscle. Long proportions, a wide split frontal face, round or square paired details and a flared body with a pronounced waist. Sporty versions carry a black stripe along the upper surface, bold side stripes, a small spoiler shape and a big number emblem. Steel rally-style motifs, vinyl bucket seating and three-spoke shapes. Palette of hot red, bright yellow, sunset orange and dark green. Loud, sun-baked and unfussy, with plenty of swagger.'),
('Gurgel','Latin America','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Gurgel, small, toylike, rugged, home-made Brazilian utility spirit. Boxy upright shapes with flat fronts, a high squared body, a doorless or canvas-top look and big rounded arches. Round forms sit in plain recessed faces with a simple slot opening, black edging and small steel forms. Bare fibreglass, flat seats and solid, shiny gelcoat surfaces. Palette of bright orange, lime green, bright yellow and sky blue. Cheerful, rugged, inventive and proudly improvised.'),
('Volkswagen do Brasil','Latin America','1970s-80s','cars','In the style of Volkswagen do Brasil, simple, sunny, pragmatic small-scale design. Rounded boxy body with rear-heavy proportions, round forms in chrome bezels, a small emblem, thin chrome edging with rubber strips and rounded bubble supports. Hot-weather details include pop-out vents and plain dish discs. Open, bare, beach-ready versions with bright paint and a stripped interior. Palette of bright yellow, sandy beige, bright orange, green and mustard. Friendly, sturdy, tropical and unpretentious.'),
('Lacoste','Europe','1930s-present','sportswear','In the style of Lacoste, polished casual sport elegance. Textured cotton pique with a small knit weave, ribbed edges and a clean, neat, slightly relaxed fit. A single small embroidered green reptile mark sits quietly on the left of the chest as the only branding. Clean tennis whites plus navy, red, sky blue, green and yellow in solid colour blocks. Terry cloth bands, white canvas and crisp, well-laundered surfaces. Sporty, preppy, understated and sunlit, with an easy club-court confidence.'),
('Patagonia','North America','1980s-present','outdoor','In the style of Patagonia, technical outdoor honesty. Fuzzy synthetic pile in colour-blocked panels of teal, red, mustard, navy and purple, with nylon shells, zip details and short, baggy, practical shapes. A small rectangular logo of a jagged mountain skyline above a sunset gradient. Recycled materials, muted but vivid earthy hues and a soft, tactile pile texture. Functional and minimal, with a climbing and surf culture spirit. Rugged, caring and unpolished, with colour used in bold blocks.'),
('Adidas','Europe','1970s-present','sportswear','In the style of Adidas, clean, sporty, street-ready athletic energy. Three parallel diagonal stripes as the core motif, with a trefoil mark of three leaves on a base. White leather with contrasting stripes in black, green or red, and shiny nylon in blue, red, black and white with stand collars and snap closures. Retro 1970s terry textures, bold colour blocks and warm gum-coloured accents. Heritage, confident, casual and playful, with a crisp terrace and track-side attitude.'),
('Converse','North America','1920s-present','footwear','In the style of Converse, simple, lightweight canvas minimalism. White rubber trim, a thin coloured stripe, flat cotton cords and metal eyelets. A small round patch with a star in a circle and tiny block capitals, plus a diamond-pattern texture. Optic white, black, red, navy, optical yellow and washed pastels in sturdy cotton duck with a slightly dirty, creased look, with leather and suede variants. Flat, heritage, court-and-garage-band feel with a 1950s to 1970s athletic mood.'),
('Nike','North America','1970s-present','footwear','In the style of Nike, high-energy athletic design dominated by a single curved checkmark with a thin tapering tail, in contrasting colour. Sculpted, performance-driven shapes, visible cushioned windows, waffle-pattern texture, layered mesh, suede and synthetic overlays and bold colour blocking in volt yellow, hot orange, royal blue, black and white. Lettering is lowercase, heavy and italic in a geometric sans-serif. Sleek technical fabrics with perforations and reflective details. Imagery uses motion blur and dramatic close crops. Fast, confident and motivating.'),
('Salomon','Europe','1990s-present','outdoor','In the style of Salomon, technical, aggressive, engineered mountain-sport design with sculpted, angular silhouettes. Sharp angled protective overlays, lugged chevron texture and bulky protective volumes. Mixed synthetic mesh, welded overlays and moulded rigid cages in black, charcoal, bright red, electric blue, lime and grey, with a curved wing-like mark in contrasting colour. Glossy plastic with hard geometric ribs and metal accents. A mix of matte and gloss, fast, slightly futuristic, set against stark white backgrounds with a precise athlete feel.'),
('Yeti','North America','2010s-present','outdoor','In the style of Yeti, overbuilt, bombproof American outdoors design. Thick, rounded-rectangular bodies, smooth thick walls and chunky rubber details with rope and tie-down accents. Matte powder-coated colour in tan, white, navy, charcoal, seafoam and desert clay, with bright accents of coral, teal and cream. Tapered, simple pill-shaped volumes on sturdy feet. A small clean bold capital wordmark sits in a rounded rectangle badge or is debossed into the surface. Minimal surfaces and a matte, rugged, heavy-duty finish.'),
('Thermos','Europe','1900s-1960s','housewares','In the style of Thermos, cheerful, practical picnic character. Tall cylindrical bodies in polished steel or red, blue and green enamel, with simple plain closures and small handles. Plaid cloth in red and green checks, colourful printed scenes on tin and domed shapes with rounded corners. Simple baked enamel paint, shiny nickel edging, embossed lettering and ribbed bands. A mid-century school-lunchroom and countryside-outing mood, bright but slightly worn painted metal.'),
('Zippo','North America','1930s-present','accessories','In the style of Zippo, compact, sturdy pocket-sized forms in highly polished chrome or brushed brass with rounded corners and snug, visible, mechanical joints that close with a click. Engraved or enamelled designs such as eagles, flags, skulls, pin-up silhouettes, flames, military insignia and checkered flat patterns, with small date-code stamps. Finishes include black crackle, matte chrome, hammered brass and etched lines. Small blocky capital stamped lettering. Classic American soldier look, slightly scratched metal, with a 1940s to 1970s Americana feel.'),
('Victorinox','Europe','1890s-present','tools','In the style of Victorinox, Swiss precision and functional compactness. Glossy translucent or matte signal red, a small white cross on a shield emblem, polished stainless steel set in neat nested layers between brass edges. Smooth rounded rectangular profiles with a pinched waist and fine laser-etched small text. Black polymer accents appear on tougher variants. Bright signal red against silver steel, tidy and orderly, with many functions folded into a small body and shown fanned open.'),
('Leatherman','North America','1980s-present','tools','In the style of Leatherman, tough, dense, industrial multi-function design, with a stack of nested elements folded neatly into a compact core. Brushed or black oxide stainless steel, precise stamped and machined parts, rounded edges with perforation holes and etched logo text. Matte bead-blast finish, riveted pivots, accents of orange or coloured anodised aluminium. Heavy, functional and garage-made in spirit, shown fanned open on a dark workbench.'),
('Shimano','East Asia','1980s-90s','bicycles','In the style of Shimano, precision-engineered mechanical forms in polished or satin silver-grey aluminium with finely machined arms, sculpted ramps and stamped steel links with shiny black plastic covers. Ergonomic combined shapes with rubber grips and stepped profiles. Laser-etched or screen-printed small capital text and model numbers, a blue or red logo on a silver ground and black and silver two-tone parts with polished highlights. Small brightly coloured stickers and jewel-like precision. Clean industrial Japanese engineering from the 1980s and 1990s, with neat blue and white graphics.'),
('Campagnolo','Europe','1960s-80s','bicycles','In the style of Campagnolo, classic Italian racing elegance in mirror-polished silver aluminium with scalloped and drilled openings, fine engraved script lettering and sculpted parallelogram bodies with slender arms. Tiny engraved lettering, a small winged wheel emblem, polished chrome bolts, hand-finished machining marks and jewel-quality metal. Paired with lugged steel, leather and cotton details. Refined mid-century racing sophistication, shining silver against dark mountain roads.'),
('Braun','Europe','1950s-70s','electronics','In the style of Braun, calm, rational, ornament-free functional design. Simple geometric volumes with softly rounded corners, tight even gaps and precise tolerances. Matte or satin surfaces in off-white, pale grey, black and graphite, with natural light wood or clear translucent material used sparingly. Details are small, round or flush and neatly grouped on a strict grid, with a single tiny accent of orange, yellow, green or red marking the one thing that matters. Lettering is thin, small and evenly spaced in clean grotesque sans-serif. Nothing decorative, generous empty space, honest, quiet and understated.'),
('Harley-Davidson','North America','1940s-present','motorcycles','In the style of Harley-Davidson, rumbling, rebellious open-road Americana. Heavy forms with a low long silhouette, deep chrome plating and fat teardrop volumes in gloss black, orange or deep red, with a small bar-and-shield emblem and pinstripe scrolls. Wide valanced curves and big round forms, fringed black leather and chunky riveted details. Mood is heavy, loud and swaggering, with black and chrome dominating and ornament worn proudly.'),
('Indian Motorcycle','North America','1930s-40s','motorcycles','In the style of Indian Motorcycle, rich, gleaming art deco Americana. Enormous deep valanced skirted curves, flowing teardrop volumes and long sweeping lines. Glossy deep red lacquer with cream or gold pinstripes and hand-lettered script, bright chrome, tan leather and a small glowing ornament. Lacquer colours such as Indian red, ivory and dark blue. Mood is lavish, streamlined and proud, with ornament and sweeping curves used generously.'),
('Triumph Motorcycles','Europe','1960s','motorcycles','In the style of Triumph Motorcycles, nostalgic British cafe-racer attitude. Compact, lean, forward-leaning proportions with small tapered volumes and a short, tight stance. Polished metal and chrome set against bright enamel colour such as silver, blaze yellow, red and pastel blue, with thin white pinstripes and a small neat enamel badge. Round, simple forms, ribbed black upholstery and fine mechanical detail left visible. Honest, hand-built, a little rebellious.'),
('Ducati','Europe','1990s-present','motorcycles','In the style of Ducati, fast, sculpted, muscular racing-bred Italian intensity. Glossy Italian red with white or black accents, exposed structure in red, visible fins, sharply tapered forms with aggressive paired lights and a short tail with a bold racing stripe. Gold or black multi-spoke circles and drilled details. Muscular, stacked and mechanical. Mood is intense, athletic and passionate, with red dominating and every shape pulled tight over the structure.'),
('Vespa','Europe','1950s-60s','scooters','In the style of Vespa, soft rounded one-piece shell forms in smooth pressed steel, with wasp-waisted curves, enclosed panels and bulbous shielding shapes. Chrome trim strips, pastel enamel in mint green, cream, sky blue, coral and ivory, and two-tone vinyl. Playful 1950s-60s Italian holiday charm. Surfaces are smooth and seamless, with no visible joins, a polished sheen and gentle highlights. Cheerful, lightweight, stylish and sunny in mood.'),
('Lambretta','Europe','1950s-60s','scooters','In the style of Lambretta, mod-era 1960s chic with minimal curves and clean engineering. Slim angular silhouette, flat-sided panels and straight horizontal lines, tall narrow forms with integrated lamps. Two-tone paint in grey, blue, cream and red, polished alloy and chrome details, thin lines and racing stripes. Mood is sharp, youthful and stylish, with a lean, tidy, engineered look and restrained ornament.'),
('Honda Super Cub','East Asia','1960s-present','motorcycles','In the style of Honda Super Cub, friendly, cheerful and utilitarian. Small, low, easy-to-enter forms with a pressed-steel spine, large clear plastic surfaces, rounded lamps and deep scalloped curves. Flat black vinyl seating, small horizontal volumes with silver finishes and small white or red accents. Solid cheerful colours such as red, white, pale blue and bright yellow with simple minimal graphics.'),
('Kawasaki','East Asia','1970s-80s','motorcycles','In the style of Kawasaki, aggressive muscle stance with racing-flag styling. Bold lime green paint as the signature colour, angular volumes with white and black stripes and square-edged covers. Large black finned forms, chrome pipes, bold sporty decals and stout rubber-gaitered parts. Loud, fast and show-off, bold and brash. Colour is saturated and unapologetic, with high-contrast graphics and an angular, aggressive attitude.'),
('Royal Enfield','South Asia','1950s-present','motorcycles','In the style of Royal Enfield, honest, rugged vintage British-Indian character. Rounded heavy build, deep teardrop volumes in gloss black, deep green, maroon or cream with pinstripes and a circular badge with a cannon emblem. Upright round chrome forms, a single long chrome tube, polished alloy covers, upright lines and a sprung tan or black leather seat. Big sweeping curved panels and fine wire-like detailing.'),
('Brough Superior','Europe','1920s-30s','motorcycles','In the style of Brough Superior, understated aristocratic racing elegance and fine craftsmanship. Hand-built, long, low, sleek silhouette, nickel-plated surfaces with black lining, polished nickel and black enamel finish and gleaming exposed mechanical forms. Slim curves, copper details, leather on springs and brass accents. Everything is slender, exacting and hand-finished and quietly rare. Mood is quiet, aristocratic and precise, with gleaming metal, black contrast and rare, bespoke refinement.'),
('Moto Guzzi','Europe','1970s','motorcycles','In the style of Moto Guzzi, smooth, solid, clean lines with a long low stance. Generous proportions with big sideways-projecting mechanical forms, polished metal drive parts, red or dark structure and teardrop volumes in Italian red, silver, black or green with a small eagle emblem. Chrome pipes, cast circles and a comfortable touring seat. Mood is calm, stout and confident, with honest mechanical forms left visible and polished metal against saturated colour.'),
('BSA','Europe','1950s-60s','motorcycles','In the style of BSA, solid, utilitarian British classic. Sturdy profile, bright finishes in polished chrome and cherry red, black or sunshine yellow, with a badge of three rifles in a circle. Rounded volumes with chrome side panels, valanced curves and bulky silver forms. Upright lines, wire-like details and a ribbed dual seat. Honest, hardy and plain-spoken, with bright metal against solid colour and a practical, no-nonsense post-war workmanlike mood.'),
('Schwinn','North America','1950s-60s','bicycles','In the style of Schwinn, heavy, swooping, streamlined mid-century American forms that look fast even when standing still. Bodies swell into deep curves with long sweeping arcs and a sculpted, bulging mid-section, balanced by fat, wide, generously rounded volumes with cream accents. Deep candy enamel in cherry red, turquoise, cream and black, edged with fine white pinstripes. Generous bright chrome on every edge and trim line. Plush padded surfaces and small playful tassel or fin details. Jet-age optimism and showroom shine.'),
('Raleigh','Europe','1950s-70s','bicycles','In the style of Raleigh, sturdy, upright, practical British engineering with quiet dignity. Slim steel members in deep racing green, black or maroon glossy enamel, with fine hand-lined gold pinstripes at the joints and a small enamelled badge showing a bird. Full chrome covers over moving parts, sprung brown leather with brass or copper rivets, cream accents and tall, upright proportions. Parts are exposed, honest and repairable. Rugged, reliable, rain-ready, sensible English craftsmanship with a post-war countryside feel.'),
('Boeing','North America','1960s-present','aircraft','In the style of Boeing, clean, confident, bright aluminium-and-white American jet-age engineering. Long smooth tubular volumes with gently rounded ends and a slightly raised swell, swept-back lines and large cylindrical forms in white and silver. White upper surfaces over polished bare metal, one narrow deep blue stripe running the full length above a tidy row of small round-cornered openings, and one tall element carrying a single large bold colour mark. Precise seams, crisp edges and white hardware. Optimistic, orderly, dependable and modern.'),
('Airbus','Europe','1990s-present','aircraft','In the style of Airbus, smooth, calm, computer-drawn European modernism. A perfectly round tubular body ending in a blunt, softly rounded end, with dark glazing wrapped in a sleek black swoosh. Slim swept lines with upturned tips that curve skyward, large round volumes and one tall element in bold colour. Clean white finish with a restrained palette of blue and white, a neat line of small rounded openings and flush, seamless surfaces. Uncluttered, cool, efficient and quietly high-tech, with a gentle sense of digital precision.'),
('de Havilland','Europe','1930s-50s','aircraft','In the style of de Havilland, light, nimble, gracefully proportioned British forms of the 1930s to 1950s. Slim bodies with smooth wooden curves, elliptical outlines and softly curved coverings that hug what is inside. Taut fabric surfaces in silver, with bright trainer yellow for contrast, and aluminium panels left bare and polished. Glazed bubble forms, fish-like pod shapes and simple round roundel marks in red, white and blue. Streamlined, clean and elegant, craftsman-built, with a hopeful pre-war and post-war amateur charm.'),
]
